try x="40" y="1294" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t55" value=": Class Utama" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="1293" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg56" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1320" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t57" value=": Master Data (Mata Kuliah &amp; Jadwal)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="1319" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg58" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1346" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t59" value=": AI / Rencana Belajar / Materi" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="1345" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg60" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1372" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t61" value=": Pendukung / Notifikasi" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="1371" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg62" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1398" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t63" value=": Integrasi LMS (Unindra)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="88" y="1397" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t64" value="&lt;b&gt;CATATAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• User = auth.users + profiles (Supabase). Class lain punya atribut user_id (FK) ke User; relasi ke User hanya digambar untuk class utama agar mudah dibaca.&lt;br&gt;• Setiap Task terkait satu Course; Task punya banyak checklist, catatan, rencana belajar (StudyPlan) dan materi (TaskMaterial).&lt;br&gt;• Task.priority: low | medium | high | urgent. Task.status: not_started | in_progress | revision | completed. Task.progress: 0-100.&lt;br&gt;• StudyPlan.risk_level: low | medium | high. AISuggestion.type: task_breakdown | study_plan | priority | notes_summary | material_breakdown | material_quiz.&lt;br&gt;• NotificationLog.reminder_type: deadline_tomorrow | deadline_today | overdue_task | today_schedule | test_message. channel = telegram.&lt;br&gt;• LmsConnection.status: disconnected | connecting | connected | expired | error. Password LMS tidak disimpan (hanya session_reference).&lt;br&gt;• Multiplicity: 1 = tepat satu, 0..1 = nol atau satu, 0..* = nol atau banyak." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#cccccc;spacing=8;fillColor=#fafafa;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="1268" width="1000" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>